  "type": "Concept",
  "prefLabel": {
    "en": "decarbonated clay",
    "es": "arcilla de descalcificación - terra rossa"
  },
  "altLabel": {
    "es": [
      "terra rossa"
    ]
  },
  "definition": {
    "en": "Alterite caused by chemical processes of dissolution of carbonate rocks in a well-defined dry season climate and characterized by rubefacted products, containing clay minerals, iron oxides and, sometimes, silica.",
    "es": "Alterita originada por procesos químicos de disolución de rocas carbonatadas, en climas con estación seca bien definida, generando residuos rubefactados, compuestos por minerales de arcillas, óxidos de hierro y, a veces, sílice."
  },
